<title>SPAIN: Spanish yields fall at 5-, 15- and one-yr auctions.</title>
<headline>Spanish yields fall at 5-, 15- and one-yr auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE	Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs	Bid    Allocated</p>
<p>1-year    6.751     6.954   93.610   93.43    933.058  419.461</p>
<p>5-year    7.319     8.110   99.70   104.20    387.173  210.443</p>
<p>15-year   7.90	8.894   103.90   94.70     55.590   33.337</p>
</text>
